<title>POLAND: IZOLACJA MARCH LOSS RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>IZOLACJA MARCH LOSS RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.27 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.27 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.23 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Sales		    5.98 vs   3.04</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.20 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.20 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.20 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Sales		   12.32 vs   6.17</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish insulation materials maker is</p>
<p>Materialy Izolacyjne Izolacja SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
